    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27923" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δολῐχ-όσκῐος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιά</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>casting a long shadow,</i> Homeric epith. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγχος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.346
			</span></i>, etc.: in later 
				Ep.
			 as a general epith., <i>long,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					1.411
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					12.181
				</span></i>
			; <i>far-reaching,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.612
				</span></i>
			, etc.</div>
